# Scope the deb.nodesource.com apt origin to nodejs (#239; the patching-hosts
# skill's policy.md "Two lanes"). The knob declares it `origin
# deb.nodesource.com follow`. NodeSource's own setup script pins nodejs and
# nsolid at 600 with no catch-all, which the probe reports as unscoped: these
# pins replace it, so don't run that script. Install: docs/DEPLOYMENT.md § Node.js.
Package: *
Pin: origin deb.nodesource.com
Pin-Priority: 100

Package: nodejs
Pin: origin deb.nodesource.com
Pin-Priority: 600
